# @rmartz/repo-hygiene is public on npmjs and installs with no auth. Pin the
# scope explicitly: a user-level or runner-level .npmrc that maps @rmartz to
# GitHub Packages (still used by other @rmartz packages) would otherwise
# redirect `npm ci` there, where versions after 7.0.1 don't exist.
@rmartz:registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/
